  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Legal Identity to Advance Rights and Inclusivity (SOLIDARITY)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to increase birth registration among Former Members of Non-State Armed Groups (FMNSAG), their families, Sama Badjaos residents in Camps, and residents of conflict-affected areas in the Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM), facilitating their access to socioeconomic opportunities in support of their transition into the civilian communities and peace process normalization track.</narrative>
  </description>
